ProteoCraft

This distribution contains ESMFold2 design and search code derived from
smiles724/ProteoCraft (public main commit
60fcbfdca59e54ff40bb209ac1bd3037ffec41aa), formerly named BindCraft v2.
Its source repository was developed from ByteDance's Protenix repository.
The original Apache License 2.0 is retained in LICENSE. Existing copyright
notices in retained files are preserved.

The vendored Protenix model, training, MSA and inference implementations are
not included. Biohub ESM/Transformers, model weights and the optional Anthropic
optimization sources are external dependencies, with their own licenses and
notices. They are not redistributed here. Model weights are not covered by
this repository's software license; consult their original model cards.

See MIGRATION_SOURCE.json and docs/MIGRATION.md for the source inventory and
the changes made for this ESMFold2-only distribution.
